title: "AutoCIM-Agent"
abstract: >-
  A LangGraph-based 7-agent HW-SW co-design optimization framework for
  Compute-In-Memory (CIM) accelerators, jointly exploring quantization,
  pruning, and crossbar mapping under hardware constraints.
